[2026-01-30T14:33:11.422Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Implementation: Unify FilterChip pattern across EntitiesView and KeyPointsPanel into shared component\n\n## Context Area\nReport Viewing System\n\n## Description\nUnify FilterChip pattern across EntitiesView and KeyPointsPanel into shared component\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n## Vision\n\nExtract the FilterChip/FilterButton pattern that is duplicated between EntitiesView and KeyPointsPanel into a shared, reusable component with consistent styling and behavior.\n\n## Business Value\n\n- Eliminates duplicate code between EntitiesView.FilterChip and KeyPointsPanel.FilterButton\n- Ensures consistent filter UI behavior across all report views\n- Reduces maintenance burden when filter styling needs updates\n- Creates foundation for adding filters to other views (Sources, Findings)\n\n## Scope\n\n**Included:**\n- Create shared FilterChip component with theme awareness\n- Support for count badges, active states, and click handlers\n- Migrate EntitiesView to use shared component\n- Migrate KeyPointsPanel to use shared component\n\n**Out of scope:**\n- Adding filter functionality to views that do not have it\n- Changing the filter logic itself\n- Building a full filter bar component (just the chip)\n\n## Key Components\n\n1. `shared/FilterChip.tsx` - New shared component\n2. Support both icon-based (emoji) and text-based labels\n3. Configurable active/inactive states with theme colors\n4. Optional count badge support\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n1. Analyze differences between EntitiesView.FilterChip and KeyPointsPanel.FilterButton\n2. Design unified API that supports both use cases\n3. Create FilterChip component with appropriate props interface\n4. Update EntitiesView to import and use shared component\n5. Update KeyPointsPanel to import and use shared component\n6. Remove inline FilterChip/FilterButton definitions\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `src/components/report/shared/FilterChip.tsx` - NEW: Shared filter chip component\n- `src/components/report/shared/index.tsx` - Export new component\n- `src/components/report/views/EntitiesView.tsx` - Use shared FilterChip\n- `src/components/report/features/KeyPointsPanel.tsx` - Use shared FilterChip (rename from FilterButton)\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- [ ] Single FilterChip component handles both current use cases\n- [ ] No duplicate filter chip implementations in the codebase\n- [ ] Both themes render correctly\n- [ ] Active/inactive states work identically\n- [ ] Count badges display properly\n\n## Potential Challenges\n\n- Subtle differences in padding/sizing (mitigation: add size prop with small/medium options)\n- Different hover behaviors (mitigation: standardize on single hover pattern)\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Read and understand the implementation details above\n2. Identify all files that need to be modified\n3. Implement the changes following the guidance provided\n4. Ensure code quality and type safety\n5. Test the changes work as expected\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an accepted Development Direction.\nFocus on implementing exactly what is described above.\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"77dbe83a-f1cc-40b7-ad76-d6b056bb7219","isSynthetic":true}
