    >\n      {label}\n      <span\n        className={`${badgeSizeClasses} rounded ${\n          active\n            ? isRadar\n              ? 'bg-cyan-500/30'\n              : 'bg-white/20'\n            : 'bg-black/10'\n        }`}\n      >\n        {count}\n      </span>\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
